  For example:

  >>> c = tf.constant([[1,2,3,4], [4, 3, 2, 1], [5,6,7,8]])
  >>> tf.math.segment_prod(c, tf.constant([0, 0, 1])).numpy()
  array([[4, 6, 6, 4],
         [5, 6, 7, 8]], dtype=int32)

